<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Biogen downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Biogen downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers confirmed that it cut its rating on Biogen Inc to outperform from buy, based on impressive share price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The fundamentals not withstanding, Biogen shares are quickly approaching our ... target thus we suggest to investors a less aggressive rating of outperform,&quot; the brokerage said in a research note.</p>
<p>Earlier a market source said Lehman had cut Biogen to outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down three at 73.</p>
</text>
